<title>USA: Holco Mortgage expects AMEX delisting.</title>
<headline>Holco Mortgage expects AMEX delisting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holco Mortgage Acceptance Corp-I said Thursday it no longer satisfies listing requirements for the American Stock Exchange and that its last day of trading will be Friday, October 25.</p>
<p>The Delaware company said its total assets have fallen from $47.8 million in 1987 to $9.7 million in June of 1996. The company said it has 563,750 common shares outstanding.</p>
